# Practices

- State assumptions; surface tradeoffs; ask when unclear; minimum code; surgical edits only.
- TDD when behavior changes: failing test → pass → refactor.
- YAGNI / DRY / KISS; same domain terms in code and docs; remove orphans you created only.
- No secrets/tokens/PII in source or logs; validate inputs; least privilege.
- Docs-as-code: update README, man pages, or `docs/` with user-visible behavior.
- Public contract changes: update the deprecation register in the same change.
- Self-review: minimal diff, error paths considered, acceptance criteria covered.
